                                "sense_id": "01687efa-6405-37d3-a38b-9cb321f34985",
                                "text": "The ASMR community struggles with popular perception of the transgressive nature of their shared pleasure, which by its public nature is what Berlant and Warner call \"nonstandard intimacy.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6bad817d-f49a-43e1-99f2-38cbe19b6ed0",
                                "sense_id": "01687efa-6405-37d3-a38b-9cb321f34985",
                                "text": "You might say [Bob] Ross was the first ASMRtist, as those who produce ASMR videos like to be called.",
                                "translation": "你可能会说鮑伯·魯斯是第一位ASMR艺术家，制作ASMR视频的人喜欢这样称呼他。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfaf73f7-3b55-4e4c-a178-5cd5f113b9c6",
                                "sense_id": "01687efa-6405-37d3-a38b-9cb321f34985",
                                "text": "“The ASMR community goes against that mainstream assertion that the internet is making everybody less connected, and hurting relationships,” Herndon says. “People are making these videos at their desks, putting them online for free, and comforting strangers in this really therapeutic and sweet way.” Her own ASMR trigger is the sound of acrylic fingernails tapping on a smartphone screen.",
                                "translation": "“ ASMR社区反对主流观点，即互联网使每个人之间的联系越来越少，并损害了人际关系，”赫恩登说。“人们在办公桌上制作这些视频，免费上传到网上，用这种真正治愈而甜蜜的方式安慰陌生人。”她自己的ASMR触发音是用水晶指甲敲击智能手机屏幕的声音。"
                            }
